        {
          "id": "81395a4",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Plastic-Craft is capable of producing a wide range of signage applications at our in-house facility. Our skilled fabricators use a CNC engraver for PVC and acrylic signs as well as a computer-controlled die cutter.</p><p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">We can create a custom multi-color vinyl sign of your logo using the latest graphics software including Adobe, CorelDRAW, SolidWorks, and AutoCAD. We also offer UV flatbed printing and create custom 3D signage that is durable and weather-resistant.</p>",
            "align": "center"
          },
          "elements": []
        }
      ],
      "isInner": false
    },
    {
      "id": "46f4800",
      "elType": "container",
      "settings": {
